# weconverge_decide — WEConverge Decide

Submit a convergence decision (continue / raise effort / explore / invoke specialist / report source_gap / report blocked). WEConverge validates evidence, cost guards and the Max ban, then returns the decided action + resolved route.

## Schema
```ts
type Args = {
  decision: {
    version: number;
    decisionId: string;
    action: string;
    difficultyType: string;
    obstacle: string;
    expectedNewInformation: string;
    successCriterion: string;
    evidenceRefs: string[];
    capability?: string;
    probes?: Array<{
      directionId: string;
      question: string;
      minimalTask: string;
      falsifier: string;
    }>;
    alternativeId?: string;
    noSafeAlternativeReason?: string;
    selectedDirectionId?: string;
    alternativeDirectionIds?: string[];
    sourceGap?: {
      missingFact: string;
      requiredSource: string;
      impact: string;
    };
  };
  evidences?: Array<{
    id: string;
    kind: string;
    summary: string;
    observedAt: string;
    sourceId: string;
    integrity: string;
  }>;
};
```
Execute by writing JSON to xd://weconverge_decide.

